      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Gr. 3-4 Drama Class (Online) Thursdays (Oct. 14 – Dec. 2) 5:15PM – 6:15PM By engaging in imaginative games, playing with different voices and exploring creative ways to express themselves physically, participants will deepen their drama skills. This term focuses on vocal and physical expression, improvisation, self-expression and confidence. (60 minutes) Learn More"
