        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Gr. 7-8A Drama Class (In-Person) Saturdays (Oct. 16 – Dec. 4) 10AM – 12PM Location: RBC WaterPark Place Students of all levels are welcome! Participants will engage in a variety of physical, vocal and improvisation games and exercises, developing confidence in their ideas, expression, ability to create on their feet and collaborate as an ensemble. […]"
