        "@value": "Gr. 6-8B Drama Class (Online) Saturdays (Oct. 16 – Dec. 4) 2:30PM – 4:30PM This fun, active class, will provide participants the chance to get up and create on their feet, developing foundational voice and movement skills, as well as character work and improvisation skills. Students will build their confidence in self-expression and collaborative work. […]"
