        "@value": "Actor’s Craft (In-Person) | Young People's Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Actor’s Craft (In-Person) Grades 9-12 Saturdays (Oct. 16 – Dec. 4) 3PM – 5PM Location: RBC WaterPark Place A stimulating and inspiring introduction to actor training and stagecraft, this script-based class exposes students to a selection of influential playwrights and acting techniques as they learn to perform a variety of characters. (120 minutes) Learn More "
      }
    ],
