      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Drama Time Program These hour-long sessions explore a particular theme through reading, dramatization, song and craft-making. The program seeks to enhance and integrate learning and literacy among young children by enabling the use of creativity, emotional expression and sensory stimulation."
      }
