        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Online Spring Break Drama Camp Register Today! Gr. 1-6 Online Register Online here or Download our Registration Package here. See details about camps, plus info about our brand new literacy-based drama camp, Do I Have a Story For You! here: https://youngpeoplestheatre.org/dramaschool/march-break/spring-break-drama-camp/&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
