        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Beauty and the Beast Teacher &amp; Community Preview At special Teacher &amp; Community Preview evenings, we offer complimentary tickets to teachers in order to provide them a sneak-peek at selected productions throughout the season. The evening includes a pre-show reception and a post-show question and answer period. Join us for a great night of superb theatre, fascinating [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
