    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;YPT Drama School Fall/Winter/Spring Registration Opens Registration is now open for our 2019/20 drama classes! In our classes, students learn new skills, gain confidence, and engage in creative and collaborative play. Check out our class schedules at each of our four locations: Downtown Toronto, Etobicoke, North York and Scarborough. While new students are welcome throughout [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
