        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Drama School Spring Presentation Weekend From June 7-9 2019, students from YPT Drama School\\'s four locations (Downtown, Etobicoke, North York and Scarborough), will be presenting shows they have collectively created on the YPT Mainstage. Friday, June 7: Junior Ensemble and Senior Company presentations Saturday, June 8: Downtown Saturday classes &amp; Scarborough presentations Sunday, June 9: [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
