        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pop-Up Drama School Full-day workshops for children (Grades 1-6) Friday, February 21, 2020 &#8211; $50/day Register for a full-day of fun with drama exercises led by experienced artist educators. Participants will share what they&#8217;ve been working on with parents and guardians at 3PM each day. 9AM &#8211; 3:30PM with early drop-off available from 8:30AM. Location: [&hellip;]"
