        "@value": "After-School Play Gr. 1-4 Downtown 4:30PM – 5:30PM Join us for a new program on Thursdays, where we take the page to the stage! In the Fall, students work on scripted scenes based on one of the plays in our season. In the Winter and Spring, students build towards performing these scenes in our Studio […]"
