    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every Thursday in July, YPT facilitates drama sessions with H.appi Camper &#8211; a camp for 75 Syrian children spending their first summer in Canada. The camp runs from July 4 &#8211; July 29. H.appi Camper is &#8220;a culturally sensitive summer camp program targeted at Syrian refugee children and adults residing in the Greater Toronto Area. The [&hellip;]"
