        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Summer Reading Series Workshop Toronto Public Library - Lillian Smith Library - Summer Reading Series Workshop July 20, 2016 4pm - 6pm Facilitated by Lois Adamson, YPT Member Schools &amp; Education Manager. YPT offers a wide range of community programs and workshops that serve to enrich neighbourhoods throughout the city. The focus of these programs [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
