        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Summer Reading Series Workshop Toronto Public Library - Barbara Frum Library - Summer Reading Series Workshop August 4, 2016 2pm - 4pm Theme: Collective Creation Facilitated by Herbie Barnes. Herbie is an Anishnabe theatre artist from Aundeck Omni Kaning on Manitoulin Island. Some of Herbie’s stage roles include Bilbo Baggins in The Hobbit (YPT, MTYP, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
