        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;EAGLE DRUM GIRL This family-friendly event is inspired by the teachings of Elder Dr. Duke Redbird. Young People’s Theatre will perform a reading of Elder Redbird\\'s play, Eagle Drum Girl, and will feature Elder Redbird himself! The premise of this inter-generational play is as follows: &quot;Dan Eagle’s son and daughter-in-law want him to move into seniors’ [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
