      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "YPT provides weekly Drama Time programs for infants, toddlers and their caregivers at Parent Resources Drop-In Centre in South Riverdale. The weekly, hour-long programs explore a particular theme through reading, dramatization, song and craft making."
