        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Toronto Newcomer Day"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Young People’s Theatre is thrilled to be part of the City of Toronto’s Newcomer Day by delivering Drama Time workshop sessions for infants, toddlers and their caregivers. Lead by a YPT Resident Artist Educator, the 20-minute sessions will explore a particular theme of “home” through reading, dramatization, and song. Through these workshops, we seek to [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
