        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Young People\\'s Theatre is partnering with The Canadian Network for Arts &amp; Learning (CNAL) to offer this year\\'s Toronto Hub with professional development artist-led workshops and an introduction to our arts and learning map of Ontario. Aline Morales Come and take part in a professional development session to learn exercises that can be applied to [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
