        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tell Me That Story Again &#8211; FREE Trial Class"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Free Trial Class: Nov. 17 at 1-2PM Have you heard about our new class on the Indigenous Tradition of Oral Storytelling and curious to find out more? Good news! On Saturday, November 17, we will be offering a free trial class so that students and caregivers alike can check out what all the excitement is [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
