        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Selfie: A Forum"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Selfie: A Forum Join us Monday, March 26, 2018 6PM-8PM Young People’s Theatre (165 Front Street East) Description of Selfie The first party of the school year comes packed with expectations. It’s a time to renew old friendships and perhaps find new love. But what happens when an incident shatters the connections between three friends? [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
